(polyline (pts (xy 20.32 114.3) (xy 398.78 114.3)) (stroke (width 0.6) (type dash)) (uuid 7ccb2a3e-a81e-4348-a1d7-55cf88e52363))
(text "24 V POWER: high current, SELV" (at 345.44 111.3 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 88b9ebc5-f193-408b-bdac-8d60ecd2c0a5))
(text "LOGIC: 3.3 V / 5 V, same ground" (at 345.44 120.3 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d9c86b0f-4b31-4e35-ab3d-aca0043f6263))
(text "No mains anywhere: the certified adapter does all the isolation. Keep motor current out of the logic ground: one star point at A2's GND." (at 20.32 112.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b8a46fb8-510d-4d83-a068-ba5d14cf8291))
(text "24 V IN: FUSE, TVS, BULK" (at 20.32 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 59a6ef79-487f-4f82-8640-063be7d8bb32))
(text "5 V BUCK" (at 114.3 44.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0fca0162-79a6-4e57-91d6-52b636619be7))
(text "BRAKE CHOPPER (optional)" (at 139.7 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1f394448-3fbe-471e-a42b-6ae824da5ed9))
(text "BUS SENSE" (at 182.88 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b42c2b31-067e-4866-bb2e-a30085dc911e))
(text "H-BRIDGE (Pololu G2 24v13 module)" (at 220.98 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 13144cfa-6528-4676-a0fb-172c334d4a92))
(text "MOTOR TERMINAL SENSE (back-EMF)" (at 297.18 77.47 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9bade6e9-d297-4b4b-9ff0-828ddfd9d8d2))
(text "RP2350B CORE BOARD (pins by GPIO number)" (at 124.46 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 21457bea-9a6a-4fb6-900b-cf4638bdcdbb))
(text "HAND-WHEEL INDEX SENSOR (one magnet, one pulse per stitch)" (at 200.66 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ef642b70-a04c-4099-90ba-f22e22ce4c4b))
(text "HAND-WHEEL ENCODER (two Hall latches, quadrature; same cable as the index)" (at 297.18 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dc360f8a-a960-4604-b5c2-467683861a99))
(text "HEEL SWITCH" (at 55.88 199.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3ba380c8-3779-4c10-8dcc-fc202ab94c14))
(text "SWITCHES (internal pull-ups)" (at 170.18 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1fe30691-c799-4e87-ad27-949e10facef7))
(text "OPERATOR INPUTS (RC-filtered ADC)" (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 660460f9-4da0-4b54-98bd-8bde62dd2d5e))
(text "NOTES. A concept drawn by Claude at Bob Drzyzgula's direction, October 2026: not built, not tested, values not checked." (at 20.32 258.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5960af0a-b16d-421b-8568-861b589faf5d))
(text "1. The mains version's control side unchanged; the triac, zero-cross, relay and isolated supply replaced by a 24 V adapter, a buck and an H-bridge." (at 20.32 261.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 183f0f3c-5da1-45c8-8003-d06e53ceedc5))
(text "2. Pins (RP2350B): PWM GP4 (20 kHz, PWM slice 2); DIR GP5; SLP GP6; FLT GP13 (internal pull-up); BRAKE GP1; HALL GP7; ENC_A/B GP2/GP3;" (at 20.32 263.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ff94478e-ae25-4499-9f6a-4577ef21a333))
(text "   STITCH GP10; HEEL GP11; NEEDLE GP12; knee, pedal, FSR, limit ADC0-3; ISENSE ADC4 (GP44); VA, VB ADC5, ADC6; VBUS_S ADC7 (GP47)." (at 20.32 265.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ed947c25-5ed4-4b9f-9329-fb8399de29dc))
(text "3. A2 truth table: PWM high drives (DIR sets the way); PWM low brakes (both outputs low). Its PWM input is pulled low on the board, so a" (at 20.32 268.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 08e7f16a-40fb-4897-8ef6-fca2b94ecdd4))
(text "   resetting MCU leaves the motor braked. CS is about 40 mV/A, valid only while driving: sample it mid on-time. No capacitor on CS." (at 20.32 270.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 988f98f5-1703-4e6a-a8c6-cb266253a969))
(text "4. R4 lowers A2's current limit from its default ~30 A (100k gives ~16 A); aim for 8-10 A and set it on the bench with the motor stalled." (at 20.32 273.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 30e63696-dae6-44cd-9dfc-a9a07499406d))
(text "5. Slow down by braking (PWM low), which spends the energy in the motor's own resistance. Never reverse at speed: that pumps the bus up." (at 20.32 275.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 280da102-d76d-43d0-81e1-e61eb60babaf))
(text "   Watch VBUS_S; if it rises past ~28 V, stop driving and fire the brake chopper (Q1, R9), if fitted. D1 only catches short spikes." (at 20.32 277.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ad4b8628-1449-41a9-8721-8fdaec8c0241))
(text "6. VA, VB read each motor terminal (/11): their difference is the motor's voltage; with A2 asleep (SLP low) it is the back-EMF, the speed." (at 20.32 280.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 880a2dbb-219e-45f2-bbbb-c4c928ab231c))
(text "7. C19 and two 47n caps from each terminal to the motor case go at the motor; twist the motor leads. PS1 feeds VSYS through D2, as before." (at 20.32 282.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ca461d5d-0826-4f91-abe8-2d36a017c31a))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
